     "to": "Maker T1 manual (docs.booster.tech > T1 > Specifications): height 1.18 m, ~30 kg, 23 DoF (6 per leg, 4 per arm expandable, 1 waist, 2 head), walking speed 1 m/s, turning 1.5 rad/s, battery life 2 h with <=2 h charge, -10 to 45 C, 5-90% humidity, depth camera + mic array + speaker, Wi-Fi 6 / BT 5.2, CE/FCC, emergency stop; Basic ships the Jetson AGX Orin (200 TOPS), Standard and Customized add an Intel i7 board. The printed spec sheet on the maker's old product page adds 10.5 Ah battery, 130 N.m peak torque and 6-mic array; pack voltage is not published so battery_wh stays empty. The product page booster.tech/booster-t1 now redirects to the T2/K1 lineup, so status recorded as Discontinued. Price is the HumanoidStore figure, not a maker price."
